<section class="wc-hero"><svg class="wc-streaks" viewBox="0 0 1400 760" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-200 60 C 200 20, 600 100, 1600 60" style="--d:3.0s;--l:120"/><path d="M-200 118 C 200 78, 600 158, 1600 118" style="--d:3.9s;--l:200"/><path d="M-200 176 C 200 136, 600 216, 1600 176" style="--d:4.8s;--l:280"/><path d="M-200 234 C 200 194, 600 274, 1600 234" style="--d:5.7s;--l:120"/><path d="M-200 292 C 200 252, 600 332, 1600 292" style="--d:3.0s;--l:200"/><path d="M-200 350 C 200 310, 600 390, 1600 350" style="--d:3.9s;--l:280"/><path d="M-200 408 C 200 368, 600 448, 1600 408" style="--d:4.8s;--l:120"/><path d="M-200 466 C 200 426, 600 506, 1600 466" style="--d:5.7s;--l:200"/><path d="M-200 524 C 200 484, 600 564, 1600 524" style="--d:3.0s;--l:280"/><path d="M-200 582 C 200 542, 600 622, 1600 582" style="--d:3.9s;--l:120"/><path d="M-200 640 C 200 600, 600 680, 1600 640" style="--d:4.8s;--l:200"/><path d="M-200 698 C 200 658, 600 738, 1600 698" style="--d:5.7s;--l:280"/></svg><div class="wc-w wc-hero-g"><div class="wc-hero-t"><p class="wc-ey">Light jackets for wild days</p><h1 aria-label="Windche"><span style="--i:0">W</span><span style="--i:1">i</span><span style="--i:2">n</span><span style="--i:3">d</span><span style="--i:4">c</span><span style="--i:5">h</span><span style="--i:6">e</span></h1><p class="wc-lead">Windbreakers, shells and light jackets, explained. Read the wind, plan your layers and pick a jacket that keeps the gusts out without weighing you down.</p><div class="wc-hero-a"><a class="wc-btn" href="#beaufort">Read the wind <svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a><a class="wc-lnk" href="windbreaker-jackets-guide.html">What is a windbreaker?</a></div></div>
<div class="wc-hero-v"><svg class="wc-sock" viewBox="0 0 300 200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M40 20v180" class="pole"/><circle cx="40" cy="20" r="6" class="cap"/><g class="wc-sk"><path d="M44 30l200 22v46L44 120z" class="sb"/><path d="M44 30l40 4.4v81.2L44 120zM124 38.8l40 4.4v59.6l-40 4.4zM204 47.6l40 4.4v46l-40 4.4z" class="ss"/></g></svg><figure class="wc-hero-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1543672039-3cc28caedb76?auto=format&fit=crop&w=560&h=640&q=75" alt="a woman in a yellow jacket on a windy beach" width="560" height="640" fetchpriority="high"></figure><div class="wc-wx"><b>18&deg;</b><span>Feels like 13&deg;<br>Gusts 38 km/h</span></div></div></div></section>

<div class="wc-mq mq" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Ripstop</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Packable</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Wind-resistant</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Breathable</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Drawcord hood</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Water-repellent</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Elastic cuffs</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Layer-friendly</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Ripstop</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Packable</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Wind-resistant</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Breathable</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Drawcord hood</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Water-repellent</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Elastic cuffs</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg><span>Layer-friendly</span><svg class="wc-ar" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h15M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></div></div>

<section class="wc-s wc-bf" id="beaufort"><div class="wc-w"><div class="wc-sh"><p class="wc-ey">Tool one</p><h2 class="rv">Beaufort wind scale</h2><p class="wc-p">Sailors have described the wind by force numbers since the early 1800s. Slide to a wind speed to see its force, what it looks like outside and what to wear.</p></div>
<div class="wc-bf-g"><div class="wc-bf-c"><label class="wc-lb" for="bf-s">Wind speed <output id="bf-so">24 km/h</output></label><input type="range" id="bf-s" min="0" max="120" value="24"><div class="wc-scale" id="bf-sc" aria-hidden="true"><i>0</i><i>1</i><i>2</i><i>3</i><i>4</i><i>5</i><i>6</i><i>7</i><i>8</i><i>9</i><i>10</i><i>11</i><i>12</i></div>
<div class="wc-bf-vis"><svg viewBox="0 0 300 200" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M40 30v170" class="pole"/><g id="bf-sk" style="transform-origin:44px 40px"><path d="M44 40l200 22v46L44 130z" class="sb"/><path d="M44 40l40 4.4v81.2L44 130zM124 48.8l40 4.4v59.6l-40 4.4zM204 57.6l40 4.4v46l-40 4.4z" class="ss"/></g></svg><figure class="wc-bf-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1717850895318-13e829daa321?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=300&q=75" alt="a windsock blowing against a blue sky" width="520" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div>
<div class="wc-card" aria-live="polite"><p class="wc-card-k">Force</p><p class="wc-force" id="bf-n">4</p><h3 id="bf-t">Moderate breeze</h3><p class="wc-mph" id="bf-m">15 mph &middot; 13 knots</p><dl><div><dt>On land</dt><dd id="bf-l"></dd></div><div><dt>What to wear</dt><dd id="bf-w"></dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section>

<section class="wc-s wc-ly" id="layers"><div class="wc-w wc-ly-g"><div><p class="wc-ey">Tool two</p><h2 class="rv">Layer planner</h2><p class="wc-p">Wind steals warmth faster than you think. Set the temperature, wind and rain to see how cold it will feel and which layers to wear.</p>
<label class="wc-lb" for="ly-t">Air temperature <output id="ly-to">10&deg;C</output></label><input type="range" id="ly-t" min="-10" max="25" value="10">
<label class="wc-lb" for="ly-w">Wind speed <output id="ly-wo">25 km/h</output></label><input type="range" id="ly-w" min="0" max="70" value="25">
<fieldset><legend>Rain</legend><div class="wc-chips" id="ly-r"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Dry</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Showers</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Steady rain</button></div></fieldset><figure class="wc-ly-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602471615287-d733c59b79c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&h=280&q=75" alt="a hiker in a light jacket in the mountains" width="600" height="280" loading="lazy"></figure></div>
<div class="wc-stack"><div class="wc-feel"><span>Feels like</span><b id="ly-f">6&deg;</b><em id="ly-fd"></em></div><ol class="wc-layers" id="ly-l"><li data-k="shell"><i></i><b>Waterproof shell</b><span>Keeps steady rain out</span></li><li data-k="wind"><i></i><b>Windbreaker</b><span>Blocks the gusts, light and packable</span></li><li data-k="mid"><i></i><b>Fleece or light insulation</b><span>Traps warm air</span></li><li data-k="base"><i></i><b>Base layer</b><span>Moves sweat off your skin</span></li></ol><p class="wc-small" id="ly-n" aria-live="polite"></p></div></div></section>

<section class="wc-s wc-ft2"><div class="wc-w wc-ft2-g"><figure class="wc-ft2-i rv rv-c"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602225729120-de2ad1402c8d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=560&h=680&q=75" alt="a yellow hood pulled up against the weather" width="560" height="680" loading="lazy"><span class="wc-rip" aria-hidden="true"></span></figure><div><p class="wc-ey">What makes a windbreaker</p><h2 class="rv">Light, tough, ready for gusts</h2><ul class="wc-feat stg"><li class="rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16v16H4zM4 10h16M4 16h16M10 4v16M16 4v16"/></svg><b>Ripstop weave</b><p>A grid of thicker threads stops small tears from spreading.</p></li><li class="rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3c4 5 6 8 6 11a6 6 0 0 1-12 0c0-3 2-6 6-11z"/></svg><b>Water-repellent finish</b><p>A durable coating makes light rain bead and roll off.</p></li><li class="rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4l16 16M20 4L4 20M12 2v20M2 12h20"/></svg><b>Mesh lining</b><p>Lets heat escape so you do not overheat when moving.</p></li><li class="rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 20c0-9 3-15 7-15s7 6 7 15M9 20c0-5 1-8 3-8s3 3 3 8"/></svg><b>Drawcord hood</b><p>Cinches tight so gusts cannot blow it back.</p></li><li class="rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 4h10v10H7zM6 14h12v6H6zM6 16h12M6 18h12"/></svg><b>Elastic cuffs</b><p>Seal the wrists against draughts.</p></li><li class="rv"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 8h14v12H5zM9 8V5h6v3M5 12h14"/></svg><b>Packs into a pocket</b><p>Folds into its own pocket for your bag.</p></li></ul></div></div></section>

<section class="wc-s wc-tl"><div class="wc-w wc-tl-h"><p class="wc-ey">This week outside</p><h2 class="rv">Every kind of windy</h2><p class="wc-p">Drag to browse</p></div><div class="hs wc-hs"><figure class="wc-tile"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1763503585903-b3615d7e6627?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=520&q=75" alt="long grass bending in the wind" width="400" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Breezy</b><span>Force 3</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="wc-tile"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1758771816404-d4de53a775fc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=520&q=75" alt="a wheat field rippling in the wind" width="400" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Fresh</b><span>Force 5</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="wc-tile"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601784078932-3df91e0b3c7d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=520&q=75" alt="a walker in a yellow jacket on a grassy hill" width="400" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Gusty</b><span>Force 4</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="wc-tile"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1763581202464-5faad6038122?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=520&q=75" alt="two friends in jackets on a windy day" width="400" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Blustery</b><span>Force 6</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="wc-tile"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601114574439-d327b1adb6b8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=520&q=75" alt="a wind turbine against a pale sky" width="400" height="520" loading="lazy"><figcaption><b>Steady</b><span>Force 4</span></figcaption></figure></div></section>

